[bold]USAGE[/]
  [cyan]{{command}} review[/] [dim]<url>[/] [--no-wait] [--no-brief] [guidance...]

Start or continue a review round on someone else's pull request, in a dedicated
workspace. The target is a pull request URL; words after it are guidance for the
turn. It runs as an intake this command follows; Ctrl-C stops following, not the
intake.

[bold]FLAGS[/]
  --no-wait   Print the intake's number instead of following it
  --no-brief  Start the round without its brief

[bold]EXAMPLES[/]
  {{command}} review https://github.com/acme/api/pull/7
  {{command}} review https://github.com/acme/api/pull/7 look at the migration first

[bold]DOCS[/]
  [link https://{{name}}hq.github.io/{{name}}/guides/review/]https://{{name}}hq.github.io/{{name}}/guides/review/[/]
